't do it  because nobody cares right right you  can't get anybody to care about what  happened three years ago because they're  worried about what's going on right now  they're worried about the next draft and  not even last year and last year it's  too early two three years ago no one  wants to do it because no one's gonna  click on it no one's gonna care people  have tried to do it no one cares and  trust me if people cared about it we  would do it and others would do it yeah  right no i i get that uh you know i  think with this whole situation with pat  shurmur odell beckham jr okay i mean  obviously hey pat schumer's an offensive  coach i'm sure he would have loved to  have odell beckham jr in the perfect  world because he's such a weapon but i  think he realized and i'm not sure it's  not best i don't know if pat shurmur's  personality lends him to uh actually  absolutely endear himself to a guy like  odell beckham jr shurmur's kind of plays  it close to the best it's kind of no  nonsense he's not going to crack a whole  lot of smiles or laugh a whole lot of  ways he's a real football coach that way  so  i think he made it did his best to kind  of get a relationship with odell beckham  jr but to me mike just from the outside  looking in and everything you read and  connecting dots it just seemed like it  all went south after the jocena anderson  interview it went from there then to  odell with the injury at the end of the  year and oh could he have maybe played  could he have not in these meaningless  football games and i think that's where  everything got lost between odell the  new york giants and that's when they  probably decided you know what we have  to start thinking about moving this guy  yeah and  look in in hindsight it's not a shock  but it's something they should have done  last year and the one question that  hasn't been answered what could they  have traded him for last year before  they paid him 21.45 million here's my  theory about why we've seen  both guys speak so much this week and  especially the conference call with dave  gettleman i think they tried to get  every question asked and answered before  everybody goes to arizona this weekend  and i think part of it is they're trying  to protect john mara from the onslaught  of questions about what is your plan why  did you do this and i think he's gonna  say well dave addressed it dave  addressed it it gives him cover now so  he doesn't have to answer tough  questions he should have to answer tough  questions because that makes sense what  you're saying but i think that this was  all let's get this out of the way now  right so when john merrill walks into  the lobby of the biltmore and everybody  gathers around him he's going to at  least have something he can point to  other than trying to fumble his way  through answering the questions all  right full hour pft live coming right  after this  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

